        "id": "NunuQ",
        "name": "Consume",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Willump takes a bite out of a minion, monster, or enemy champion, dealing damage and healing himself.",
        "bodyHtml": "Nunu asks Willump to take a bite of an enemy, dealing <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-500 font-semibold\">400/600/800/1000/1200 true damage</span> and restoring <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">(65/95/125/155/185 + ([[si:scalehealth]]10% bonus Health) + ([[si:scaleap]]90% Ability Power)) Health</span> when used against a minion or jungle monster. Against a champion, it instead deals <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(60/100/140/180/220 + ([[si:scalehealth]]5% bonus Health) + ([[si:scaleap]]65% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> and restores <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">(39/57/75/93/111 + (6% bonus Health) + (54% Ability Power)) Health</span>.<br /><br />The <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">healing</span> is increased by 50% when Nunu and Willump are below 50% Health.",
