      "E": {
        "slot": "E",
        "id": "NunuE",
        "name": "Snowball Barrage",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Nunu throws multiple snowballs that damage enemies.  When he's finished, Willump roots any champions or large monsters that were hit by a snowball.",
        "bodyHtml": "Nunu throws three snowballs, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(15/22.5/30/37.5/45 + ([[si:scaleap]]12% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> per snowball and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowing</span> enemies hit by all three by 30/35/40/45/50% for 1 second. Nunu can <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recast</span> this up to twice more.<br /><br />After 3 seconds, Nunu <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Roots</span> all nearby enemies that had been <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowed</span> by the snowballs for (0.5 ~ 1.5) seconds and deals an additional <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(20/30/40/50/60 + ([[si:scaleap]]80% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Nunu can only <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slow</span> each enemy once with this Ability.</span>",
