        "name": "Absolute Zero",
        "maxRank": 3,
        "summary": "Nunu & Willump create a powerful blizzard in an area that slows enemies and deals massive damage at the end.",
        "bodyHtml": "Nunu and Willump channel a powerful blizzard for up to 3 seconds. Enemies inside are <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowed</span> by 50%, increasing to 95% over the duration. Nunu and Willump also gain <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-300\">(65/75/85 + ([[si:scalehealth]]30/40/50% bonus Health) + ([[si:scaleap]]150% Ability Power)) Shield</span> for the duration before decaying over 3 seconds afterwards.<br /><br />When the blizzard ends, it detonates, dealing up to <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(625/925/1275 + ([[si:scaleap]]300% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> based on channel time. Nunu and Willump can <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recast</span> to end the blizzard early.",
